     2342   end.
     2343   for each bf_tt-clcparts
     2344   on error undo, return error return-value
     2345   :
     2346   if v-calcbypart then do:
     2347             assign
     2348             parcur-base =   bf_tt-clcparts.part-cur-base
     2349             parcur-road-tax = bf_tt-clcparts.part-cur-road-tax
     2350             parcur-excise =   bf_tt-clcparts.part-cur-excise
     2351             .
     2352   end.
